From f0f3a0e342414ea48e265193263055c77c13794f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Andr=C3=A9=20Machado?= <machaddr@falanet.org>
Date: Sun, 9 Aug 2026 10:31:52 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 13/53] drm/imagination: recognize the JH7110 GPU as
 experimental

Recognize exact BVNC 36.50.54.182 behind the existing exp_hw_support
gate. The core remains unsupported by default and requires an explicit
experimental opt-in.

Assisted-by: Codex:gpt-5
---
 drivers/gpu/drm/imagination/pvr_device.c | 3 +++
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+)

diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/imagination/pvr_device.c b/drivers/gpu/drm/imagination/pvr_device.c
index d4d40704e67183f1939d701408c7731181f97e05..0ef3583fed38bb4a5fa69a0b2f6d7a7bcc701cb8 100644
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/imagination/pvr_device.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/imagination/pvr_device.c
@@ -556,6 +556,9 @@ pvr_gpu_support_level(const struct pvr_gpu_id *gpu_id)
 	case PVR_PACKED_BVNC(36, 53, 104, 796):
 		return PVR_GPU_SUPPORTED;
 
+	case PVR_PACKED_BVNC(36, 50, 54, 182):
+		return PVR_GPU_EXPERIMENTAL;
+
 	default:
 		return PVR_GPU_UNKNOWN;
 	}
-- 
